# Clockify - FREE Time Tracking Software

> Clockify is a free time tracking and timesheet software for teams and individuals. It helps you track work hours, billable time, manage projects, and generate reports — free forever, for unlimited users.

## Main Features
- [Timer] (https://clockify.me/features/timer): Clockify's Timer feature allows users to track time in real-time using a stopwatch, manually enter hours, categorize time entries, and mark hours as billable. 
- [Timesheet] (https://clockify.me/features/timesheet): Clockify Timesheets let users log, categorize, and manage weekly work hours efficiently with team collaboration and approval features.
- [Reports] (https://clockify.me/features/reports): Clockify Reports provide customizable time and cost breakdowns with charts and comparisons of estimated vs. actual work.
- [Projects] (https://clockify.me/features/projects): Clockify's Projects feature enables users to create and manage projects with customizable tasks, set time and budget estimates, track progress, assign roles, and monitor performance through forecasting and alerts.
- [Scheduling] (https://clockify.me/features/scheduling): Clockify’s Scheduling feature allows teams to plan shifts, assign tasks, manage time off, and track capacity with visual timelines and forecasting tools. 
- [Expenses] (https://clockify.me/features/expenses): Clockify’s Expenses feature allows users to record, categorize, and manage work-related expenses, attach receipts, mark items as billable, and generate reports for approval and invoicing.
- [Invoicing] (https://clockify.me/features/invoicing): Clockify’s Invoicing feature lets users generate and send invoices from tracked time and expenses with customizable templates and export options.
- [More features] (https://clockify.me/features/): Discover additional Clockify tools like Calendar, Auto Tracker, Kiosk, Time Off, Approvals, and Team management to boost productivity and oversight.

